%% align.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): justification & areas.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "DarkSlateGray", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Alignment

left, center, right, fill
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Three justifications

%size 5, fore "white"
%left
\%left hugs this edge
%center
\%center splits the difference
%right
\%right hugs the other edge
%size 3, fore "gray70", center

(each line carries its own directive)
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Left-fill folding

%size 4, fore "white", leftfill
leftfill left-justifies AND folds a long paragraph onto the next line instead of running off the page edge, which is what this sentence is here to demonstrate.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Drawing areas

%size 4, fore "white", center
the full 90% area (the deck default)
%area 50 50 45 40
%size 5, fore "gold", leftfill
\%area 50 50 45 40 confines everything after it to a half-size box offset toward the corner - sizes go relative to the area.
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: bullets.mgp
